.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Lev Landau solved the quantum mechanics of a charged particle in a uniform magnetic field B directly, with no lattice involved: the classically continuous cyclotron motion collapses into equally spaced, macroscopically degenerate levels E_n = \hbar\omega_c(n+1/2), landau_level_energies. Each level holds n_B states per unit area, landau_degeneracy, growing linearly with B -- the origin of Landau diamagnetism, and the reason a 2D electron gas&#x27;s Landau-level filling factor \nu=n_e/n_B (~physicskit.condensed.landau_levels.filling_factor) is the natural variable of the quantum Hall effect.">

